WEBVTT

00:00.160 --> 00:04.520
Original translation by WolfPack Productions

00:02.820 --> 00:07.670
<i>The legend of the ten warriors who once saved the Digital World...</i>

00:04.520 --> 00:08.520
TLC, editing, timing, typesetting & encoding by PositronCannon

00:07.990 --> 00:10.370
<i>is now reborn.</i>

00:08.520 --> 00:12.520
Additional translations, TLC & QC by Lord Starfish

00:32.940 --> 00:37.740
<b>Kusubutteta mune ni nageirero fire!!</b>

00:32.940 --> 00:37.740
The fire burns in your smoking heart

00:37.740 --> 00:44.000
<b>Chiheisen e kokoro tobasunda</b>

00:37.740 --> 00:44.000
Let your soul fly towards the horizon

00:44.540 --> 00:49.000
<b>Kara mawari no kimochi o keri agetara</b>

00:44.540 --> 00:49.000
Kicking up this entangled feeling

00:49.000 --> 00:53.340
<b>Saki ni iku ze tsugi no furontia</b>

00:49.000 --> 00:53.340
Let's get to the next frontier first

00:54.840 --> 00:57.800
<b>Kanau sa kanau</b>

00:54.840 --> 00:57.800
It will come true, it will

00:57.800 --> 01:00.760
<b>Hakkaten wa mou sugu da ze</b>

00:57.800 --> 01:00.760
The point of ignition is right there

01:00.760 --> 01:03.560
<b>Dekiru dekiru sa</b>

01:00.760 --> 01:03.560
It's possible, it can be done

01:03.560 --> 01:06.560
<b>Bakuhatsu shite miserunda</b>

01:03.560 --> 01:06.560
I'll show you I can explode

01:06.560 --> 01:09.020
<b>Burn up'n go!!</b>

01:06.560 --> 01:09.020
Burn up'n go!!

01:11.230 --> 01:16.650
<b>Gomibako o tobi koeta saki ni aru mirai</b>

01:11.230 --> 01:16.650
Take flight towards the future beyond the trash can

01:17.280 --> 01:21.080
<b>Hikari o matotte get a fire power!!</b>

01:17.280 --> 01:21.080
Gather the light and get a fire power!!

01:22.830 --> 01:28.330
<b>Giragira to moe agare hitomi no chikara</b>

01:22.830 --> 01:28.330
Your eyes burn up with the strength

01:28.790 --> 01:32.800
<b>Kesenai yuuki de get a fire power!!</b>

01:28.790 --> 01:32.800
With unstoppable courage, get a fire power!!

01:33.460 --> 01:38.760
<b>Michi ga michiteru furontia e</b>

01:33.460 --> 01:38.760
To the frontier full of the unknown

01:39.370 --> 01:44.260
<b>Hashiri tsuzukerunda kimi o tsurete</b>

01:39.370 --> 01:44.260
I continue to run, taking you along

01:45.600 --> 01:53.980
<b><i>The Legendary Warrior!</i></b>

01:45.600 --> 01:53.980
<b><i>Agnimon of Fire</i></b>

01:47.910 --> 01:51.520
"The Legendary Warrior! Agnimon of Fire"

02:01.960 --> 02:03.780
"To decide your future"...?

02:04.240 --> 02:05.950
Here!

02:06.830 --> 02:08.060
Papa!

02:08.600 --> 02:10.060
Yes, hello?

02:26.470 --> 02:27.680
I-is this...

02:30.540 --> 02:32.540
My... future?

02:38.360 --> 02:40.560
Eh? You'll be late?

02:40.560 --> 02:42.820
But it's Shinya's birthday!

02:42.820 --> 02:45.160
Tell him to come home soon!

02:45.830 --> 02:47.370
And Shinya's present?

02:47.810 --> 02:49.020
Takuya, stop that.

02:49.900 --> 02:52.110
Oh, so you did buy one?

02:52.110 --> 02:53.900
Boring...

02:53.900 --> 02:55.700
Let's just hurry up and eat.

02:58.260 --> 03:00.470
Hey, phone call!

03:02.620 --> 03:06.560
"Would you like to start? Or not?"

03:07.070 --> 03:08.200
What's this?

03:12.700 --> 03:14.650
<i>Kanbara Takuya-kun.</i>

03:15.530 --> 03:19.200
<i>The game to decide your future has started.</i>

03:21.880 --> 03:23.910
H-how do you know my name?

03:25.800 --> 03:32.370
"Please take the train from Jiyugaoka Station to Shibuya at 17:45".

03:35.600 --> 03:38.100
<i>"To decide your future", huh...</i>

03:39.220 --> 03:40.320
Alright.

03:40.320 --> 03:41.880
Okay, understood.

03:41.880 --> 03:44.280
But come home as soon as you can, okay?

03:45.000 --> 03:46.430
Takuya, where are you going?

03:53.640 --> 03:55.730
To decide my future...

04:04.840 --> 04:06.220
H-hey!

04:07.010 --> 04:07.950
Alright!

04:10.400 --> 04:12.300
Excuse me, what time is it?

04:13.920 --> 04:15.960
It's 17:40, but...

04:15.960 --> 04:17.280
Oh, no!

04:18.500 --> 04:20.740
Hey, are you okay?

04:29.030 --> 04:30.690
Gotta hurry!

04:35.110 --> 04:38.400
Oh no, the train is here!

04:40.830 --> 04:43.200
I didn't bring any money!

04:49.210 --> 04:50.450
A ticket?

04:51.050 --> 04:52.440
Lucky!

04:55.220 --> 04:57.610
I'm getting on, I'm getting on!

05:23.660 --> 05:28.030
"Please switch trains to the subway from Shibuya Station at 18:00".

05:28.030 --> 05:29.990
<i>18:00...</i>

05:36.360 --> 05:38.740
It's impossible!

05:46.800 --> 05:49.070
<i>Shibuya, Shibuya...</i>

05:49.070 --> 05:50.840
The subway...

05:56.820 --> 05:58.450
Could he also be...

06:08.310 --> 06:09.360
He's...

06:22.190 --> 06:23.780
You got this too?

06:26.290 --> 06:27.780
What?

06:34.720 --> 06:38.890
H... how deep are we going!?

06:51.340 --> 06:53.820
Th-this is...

06:54.980 --> 06:58.370
Don't tell me everyone was called here like we were...

07:01.770 --> 07:03.690
<i>This is the final choice.</i>

07:03.690 --> 07:04.920
<i>Will you get on?</i>

07:05.600 --> 07:07.150
<i>Or will you leave?</i>

07:16.600 --> 07:17.960
Get on!

08:00.220 --> 08:01.480
There's no one here.

08:12.550 --> 08:14.990
Did all of you get this?

08:16.430 --> 08:20.490
So, including you, there were four people who got on this train...

08:20.760 --> 08:22.100
Four?

08:22.100 --> 08:23.150
But...

08:24.710 --> 08:27.820
But... why did you guys get on?

08:27.820 --> 08:29.040
Who are you?

08:29.890 --> 08:33.280
What, do I have to tell you why I do everything I do?

08:33.600 --> 08:34.580
N-not really...

08:34.580 --> 08:36.400
What about yourself?

08:37.870 --> 08:39.170
I...

08:39.900 --> 08:43.880
Right, I got on because I felt I had to!

08:44.600 --> 08:47.230
I did because I thought it would be interesting.

08:48.750 --> 08:51.440
Really? Same here, actually.

08:52.680 --> 08:55.350
I'm Shibayama Junpei. And you?

08:56.090 --> 08:58.370
I'm Orimoto Izumi.

08:58.890 --> 09:02.060
I'm Kanbara Takuya. Nice to meet you.

09:02.060 --> 09:03.220
Um...

09:03.990 --> 09:05.020
And you?

09:07.060 --> 09:09.770
I'm Himi Tomoki...

09:11.460 --> 09:12.380
Tomoki...

09:12.960 --> 09:14.670
I didn't want to get on...

09:16.050 --> 09:17.880
I didn't want to get on but...

09:19.770 --> 09:22.050
I got pushed in by bullies.

09:25.540 --> 09:28.100
I didn't want to get on!

09:52.720 --> 09:53.750
Huh?

09:54.140 --> 09:56.970
<i>This is your Digivice.</i>

09:57.340 --> 09:59.930
<i>Welcome to the Digital World.</i>

10:00.370 --> 10:02.340
Digital World...?

10:23.370 --> 10:24.710
What was that?

10:25.290 --> 10:26.740
A whistle?

10:27.830 --> 10:29.560
What are those?

10:29.870 --> 10:31.150
Aren't they birds?

10:31.150 --> 10:32.250
Birds?

10:44.800 --> 10:45.940
This is...

11:04.160 --> 11:07.680
This is... the Digital World?

11:46.240 --> 11:47.570
They're humans!

11:47.570 --> 11:49.700
Humans!

11:55.050 --> 11:57.630
How long did you intend to stay on?

11:57.630 --> 12:00.590
Wait... the train talks?

12:00.590 --> 12:02.760
I'm no train.

12:02.760 --> 12:06.060
I'm the Trailmon "Worm".

12:06.470 --> 12:11.180
This is Fire Terminal, a Digimon town.

12:11.740 --> 12:13.540
A Digimon town...

12:19.300 --> 12:21.180
Th-this isn't good...

12:24.130 --> 12:26.050
I want to go home!

12:26.050 --> 12:29.080
Papa! Mama!

12:32.440 --> 12:36.890
If you want to go home so badly, obtain the Spirits!

12:36.890 --> 12:38.290
Spirits?

12:38.290 --> 12:41.090
Wh-what are those? Where are they?

12:42.900 --> 12:44.960
H-hey, answer us!

12:44.960 --> 12:46.840
Answer us!

12:46.840 --> 12:50.560
No! I want to go home!

12:51.880 --> 12:53.150
H-hey!

12:53.150 --> 12:54.740
I'm going home!

12:54.740 --> 12:57.270
Where are you going, Tomoki!?

12:59.980 --> 13:01.920
I'm going home!

13:02.850 --> 13:03.650
Tomoki!

13:03.650 --> 13:05.610
Stop, Tomoki!

13:07.160 --> 13:08.740
If you want to go home that badly...

13:09.260 --> 13:11.000
I'll take you home!

13:12.690 --> 13:17.500
Trailmon said it himself! If we find those Spirits, we can go back!

13:18.420 --> 13:19.570
Really?

13:22.620 --> 13:23.450
Tomoki!

13:23.450 --> 13:25.150
I-I'm okay.

13:28.060 --> 13:30.390
Wait there, don't move!

13:35.690 --> 13:38.320
H-help us, help us!

13:42.810 --> 13:44.260
Look, a human.

13:44.260 --> 13:45.410
Human?

13:46.030 --> 13:47.740
See, a human child.

13:47.740 --> 13:50.660
U-um... save you from what?

13:50.660 --> 13:52.460
Oh yeah, I forgot.

13:52.460 --> 13:53.880
I forgot.

13:56.500 --> 13:58.330
It's Cerberumon!

13:58.330 --> 13:59.750
Cerberumon?

14:01.040 --> 14:03.300
Demon Beast Digimon, Cerberumon.

14:03.300 --> 14:05.750
The watchdog from Hell who guards the Dark Area.

14:05.750 --> 14:08.510
His special attack is Hell Fire.

14:08.510 --> 14:10.470
Where is the Spirit?

14:10.470 --> 14:11.640
Spirit?

14:12.070 --> 14:14.360
W-we told you we didn't know!

14:14.360 --> 14:15.390
We told you...

14:15.390 --> 14:16.930
Liars!

14:16.930 --> 14:20.900
This town reeks of one of the Legendary Spirits!

14:21.230 --> 14:23.410
Legendary Spirit?

14:25.420 --> 14:27.890
So you <i>do</i> know...

14:31.250 --> 14:33.330
Hell Fire!

14:35.910 --> 14:38.060
Hurry up and run, you idiot!

14:38.060 --> 14:40.580
Wh-what do you mean "you idiot"?

14:45.010 --> 14:45.670
Tomoki!

14:45.670 --> 14:46.810
Takuya-oniichan!

14:46.810 --> 14:50.980
That Cerberumon... is he trying to eat up this town's DigiCode?

14:53.510 --> 14:54.430
Takuya!

14:54.430 --> 14:55.810
Tomoki!

15:08.750 --> 15:10.620
Th-the Digivice...

15:12.350 --> 15:13.370
What?

15:24.440 --> 15:25.150
What's that?

15:25.150 --> 15:26.500
Oh... that's...

15:29.470 --> 15:33.800
This is... a Legendary Spirit!

15:33.800 --> 15:36.140
Legendary Spirit...

15:37.250 --> 15:38.770
So with this...

15:40.670 --> 15:43.040
I can take Tomoki home!

15:43.040 --> 15:44.580
Found it.

15:45.480 --> 15:48.200
At last, the Legendary Spirit.

15:56.430 --> 15:57.580
Stay back!

16:01.060 --> 16:03.910
I won't let you have the Spirit!

16:03.910 --> 16:05.420
Move!

16:15.960 --> 16:19.110
So this is one of the ten Legendary Warrior Spirits...

16:21.950 --> 16:23.200
Why!?

16:23.200 --> 16:26.660
Not even the flames of Hell affect me!

16:29.500 --> 16:30.780
Damn it...

16:31.260 --> 16:32.490
Where's Takuya-oniichan?

16:35.310 --> 16:36.780
It's not hot...

16:40.070 --> 16:41.370
Spirit...

16:51.580 --> 16:53.550
Spirit!

17:16.160 --> 17:17.360
Spirit...

17:18.350 --> 17:20.150
Evolution!

17:37.970 --> 17:39.660
Agnimon!

17:39.970 --> 17:44.590
<b>Kaze wo ukete tatsu kewashii gake de wa</b>

17:39.970 --> 17:44.590
Standing at a steep cliff and feeling the wind

17:43.020 --> 17:46.230
What? A human evolved into a Digimon?

17:45.260 --> 17:50.460
<b>Jibun no yowasa bakari ga mieru ne</b>

17:45.260 --> 17:50.460
You can't see anything but your own weakness

17:47.900 --> 17:49.570
C-cool...

17:49.570 --> 17:51.050
Could this be...

17:50.890 --> 17:55.730
<b>Demo donna pinchi mo haruka e toberu</b>

17:50.890 --> 17:55.730
But any pinch we encounter conceals a miracle

17:53.980 --> 17:55.200
T-Takuya turned...

17:55.200 --> 17:56.400
Into a Digimon...

17:56.400 --> 18:01.950
<b>chansu ni mo kawaru kiseki kakushimotteru</b>

17:56.400 --> 18:01.950
that can turn into a chance to fly away from here

17:58.330 --> 18:01.950
Th-this is one of the ten Legendary Warriors...

18:01.950 --> 18:07.060
<b>Densetsu ni wa musuu no hiiroo</b>

18:01.950 --> 18:07.060
There are countless heroes in the legends

18:02.850 --> 18:05.000
Agnimon of Fire!

18:07.660 --> 18:12.850
<b>Esoragoto to itterarenai</b>

18:07.660 --> 18:12.850
You can't say it's just a pipe dream

18:08.210 --> 18:10.330
Agnimon of Fire!?

18:13.580 --> 18:19.330
<b>Yuusha ni ima iki wo fukikome wakatteiru sa</b>

18:13.580 --> 18:19.330
Now, blow life into the heroes. I know that

18:16.130 --> 18:17.260
Agnimon!

18:19.330 --> 18:24.860
<b>ichiban daiji na buki wa kokoro ni arun da</b>

18:19.330 --> 18:24.860
the most important weapon lies in my heart

18:24.860 --> 18:28.240
<b>Makerarenai tsuyoku aritai</b>

18:24.860 --> 18:28.240
I won't lose, because I want to be strong

18:24.890 --> 18:26.060
Take care of them.

18:28.140 --> 18:30.040
Prodigio!

18:28.740 --> 18:34.450
<b>Kizu darake demo akogareteta mirai e to</b>

18:28.740 --> 18:34.450
Even if I'm covered in scars, I will go to the future I long for

18:31.470 --> 18:33.500
Inferno Gate!

18:33.820 --> 18:34.880
What?

18:34.450 --> 18:36.770
<b>Tabidate With The Will</b>

18:34.450 --> 18:36.770
Setting off, With The Will

18:46.440 --> 18:50.670
No one has ever left this Dark Area alive!

18:54.450 --> 18:55.550
What?

19:00.760 --> 19:01.710
There you are!

19:02.430 --> 19:04.840
Good job predicting my attack. However...

19:04.840 --> 19:06.150
Hell Fire!

19:13.260 --> 19:16.400
Agnimon will not be burned by your puny flames!

19:20.970 --> 19:21.950
What the?

19:30.000 --> 19:32.210
There's fire coming from the Dark Area!

19:34.210 --> 19:37.450
Salamander Break!

19:38.740 --> 19:40.520
A human child...

19:47.550 --> 19:48.810
Cool!

19:48.810 --> 19:50.140
Commozione!

19:53.600 --> 19:55.770
Corrupted, evil soul...

20:00.360 --> 20:02.840
This Digivice will purify you!

20:05.030 --> 20:06.280
DigiCode...

20:06.820 --> 20:07.740
Scan!

20:21.530 --> 20:23.960
What will happen to that egg?

20:23.960 --> 20:25.670
You're so uncultured...

20:25.670 --> 20:30.440
Cerberumon will awaken in a different time, in a different place.

20:30.840 --> 20:31.730
Don't look!

20:40.740 --> 20:42.700
Wh-what happened?

20:43.760 --> 20:45.360
I became a Digimon...

20:46.200 --> 20:48.400
<i>You are a Chosen Child.</i>

20:48.810 --> 20:50.160
Chosen?

20:50.410 --> 20:52.410
<i>But please do not forget.</i>

20:52.410 --> 20:56.130
<i>The choice to come here was yours alone.</i>

20:56.500 --> 20:58.090
Mine alone...

21:11.080 --> 21:18.060
<b>Donna ni hanarete itemo...</b>

21:11.080 --> 21:18.060
No matter how far apart we are...

21:27.360 --> 21:34.660
<b>Miageta sora kimi wa tooi basho de</b>

21:27.360 --> 21:34.660
Looking up at the sky, you are far away

21:35.500 --> 21:37.500
<b>Onaji keshiki</b>

21:35.500 --> 21:37.500
I wonder if

21:39.590 --> 21:42.590
<b>mitsumete iru no ka na</b>

21:39.590 --> 21:42.590
you're looking at the same scenery?

21:43.710 --> 21:46.720
<b>Todokanai</b>

21:43.710 --> 21:46.720
The feelings

21:47.680 --> 21:50.010
<b>omoi o</b>

21:47.680 --> 21:50.010
that won't reach you

21:50.430 --> 21:54.890
<b>Mune ni kizamitsuke hashittetanda</b>

21:50.430 --> 21:54.890
I engrave them in my heart and run

21:54.890 --> 22:01.770
<b>Bokutachi ga yumemita ashita ni</b>

21:54.890 --> 22:01.770
The tomorrow that we dreamed of

22:01.770 --> 22:04.490
<b>Hibiku yo</b>

22:01.770 --> 22:04.490
Your laughter

22:04.490 --> 22:08.950
<b>kimi no warai goe</b>

22:04.490 --> 22:08.950
echoes in it

22:09.490 --> 22:10.870
<b>Dakara</b>

22:09.490 --> 22:10.870
So

22:10.870 --> 22:17.620
<b>bokutachi ga atarashii kaze o</b>

22:10.870 --> 22:17.620
Let's create a new wind

22:17.620 --> 22:26.520
<b>Okosou mujaki na mama de</b>

22:17.620 --> 22:26.520
Remaining innocent

22:38.390 --> 22:41.860
We can't run away! Takuya, help!

22:41.860 --> 22:43.940
The Pagumon will melt us!

22:43.940 --> 22:45.900
So you're telling me to evolve?

22:45.900 --> 22:47.400
Spirit Evolution!

22:47.400 --> 22:49.780
Huh? Another human turned into a Digimon?

22:49.780 --> 22:51.950
Koji, you can evolve too?

22:51.950 --> 22:54.580
Could it be another Legendary Warrior?

22:54.580 --> 22:56.580
Next time, on Digimon Frontier!

22:56.580 --> 22:59.960
"Wolfmon of Light - Battle in the Underground Maze!"

22:58.500 --> 23:01.500
<b>Wolfmon of Light</b>

22:58.500 --> 23:01.500
<b>Battle in the Underground Maze!</b>

22:59.960 --> 23:02.420
Now, the legend evolves.
